### IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client requests against the gateway
@api = http://localhost:8080/api
@dealer = TQ-BLR-IND

### Dealers and bays
GET {{api}}/dealers

### Service catalogue (durations per vehicle type)
GET {{api}}/dealers/service-types

### Bike availability tomorrow (change the date)
GET {{api}}/appointments/availability?dealerId={{dealer}}&vehicleType=BIKE&serviceType=GENERAL_SERVICE&date=2026-12-01

### Book a bike
POST {{api}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{
  "dealerId": "{{dealer}}",
  "customerName": "Asha Rao",
  "customerPhone": "9845012345",
  "vehicleType": "BIKE",
  "vehicleNumber": "KA03 HB 1234",
  "vehicleMake": "Royal Enfield",
  "vehicleModel": "Classic 350",
  "serviceType": "GENERAL_SERVICE",
  "slotStart": "2026-12-01T10:00"
}

### Book a car
POST {{api}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealerId": "{{dealer}}",
  "customerName": "Vikram Shetty",
  "customerPhone": "9845098765",
  "vehicleType": "CAR",
  "vehicleNumber": "KA01 MJ 4321",
  "vehicleMake": "Hyundai",
  "vehicleModel": "Creta",
  "serviceType": "WHEEL_ALIGNMENT",
  "slotStart": "2026-12-01T11:00"
}

### Check in (replace id)
POST {{api}}/appointments/REPLACE_ID/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "odometerKm": 18500 }

### Repair orders at the dealer
GET {{api}}/repair-orders?dealerId={{dealer}}

### Assign / request parts / complete (replace id)
POST {{api}}/repair-orders/REPLACE_ID/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{ "technician": "Ravi K" }

###
POST {{api}}/repair-orders/REPLACE_ID/parts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lines": [ { "sku": "OIL-10W30-1L", "quantity": 1 }, { "sku": "SPARK-PLUG-BIKE", "quantity": 1 } ] }

###
POST {{api}}/repair-orders/REPLACE_ID/complete

### Bike parts (includes universal consumables)
GET {{api}}/parts?dealerId={{dealer}}&fitment=BIKE

### Low stock
GET {{api}}/parts/low-stock?dealerId={{dealer}}

### Notifications
GET {{api}}/notifications?limit=20
